    "annotations_dropped": [
      {
        "annotation_id": "4d5da1b016f1434d8f1fd09bb82eeedc_4",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "RLC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "He was sentenced to undergo simple imprisonment for a period of six months along with a fine of Rs.\n1000/- in default to suffer imprisonment for a further period of one month."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9b6e362a6b764300ae6fa893cf038379_5",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "RLC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n2. The appeal of the appellant against the order of conviction and sentence by the Trial Court was dismissed by the Additional District and Sessions Judge, Bench-II, City Sessions Court in connection with Criminal Appeal No. 36 of 2002 vid"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "61c1c38a905249d890ecd798348841a7_12",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "RLC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The said complaint came up for trial before the Ld. Municipal Magistrate, Calcutta and on conclusion of trial the Ld. Magistrate found the accused guilty for committing offence under Section 16(1) (a) (i) of the Act and convicted and senten"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "fec3d2c99497449fb88650a9185243c5_13",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "RLC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Being aggrieved and dissatisfied with the impugned judgment and order of conviction an appeal was filed by the petitioner herein which was then heard by the then Additional District and Sessions Judge, 9th Fast Track Court, Calcutta which w"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "6fe717e553be49bca3012b4f850a79cb_14",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "RLC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC",
          "explicit_leakage_phrase"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [
          {
            "pattern": "\\bset\\s+aside\\b",
            "matched_text": "set aside",
            "start": 155,
            "end": 164
          }
        ],
        "text_preview": "After disposal of the said appeal the appellant moved this Court against the said order in Revision and the Co-ordinate Bench of this Court was pleased to set aside the order of the Additional District and Sessions Judge, 9th Fast Track Cou"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0827ccd4926c485fa9d9433543ba94d6_28",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "11. Upon careful perusal of the evidence collected especially exhibit 10 i.e. the public analyst report it comes to my notice that the public analyst clearly mentioned that 3 plastic packets of chilli powder of 50gms each was sent to him."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b2eb0379286e4d0c8b9f2eda1d539973_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It further transpires that the public analyst physically examined the sample of chilli powder wherein it was printed 'Double Star spices'."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "56e1c3fc85354564ba86eb51f122fdd2_30",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In addition to that it has been specifically stated that there was no declaration regarding manufacture date, net weight and complete address which is in contravention of the provision of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Rules, 1955 (for"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "cf85b134e2024dc49a33a21e518fe28a_31",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Now coming to the evidence of PW2 i.e. the Food Inspector he has already stated that he collected 450 gms of chilli powder in 9 packets of 50 gms each in presence of independent witness(PW3) who testified that collection of sample of chilli"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c611e136d0284d2ba415136573eb95cf_32",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "This being so, it cannot be said that the public analyst did not analyze the sample which was taken from the shop of the petitioner by the Food Inspector."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ffd153dc2086470ba41d284e2df7014b_33",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The report of the public analyst further ratifies the bona fide of the Food Inspector and emphasizes that there has been a contravention of Rule 32(c),(d)& (f) of the Rules."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b2cd5bd409e54d46a293c537c915d2d7_34",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "12. Moreso, the petitioner herein also has not challenged the procedure of seizure by the Food Inspector."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "11a7a1d2c4e244bda742a330ddf7e096_35",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Actually, the petitioner himself has further buttressed the case of the prosecution by the reply given by him in course of his examination under Section 313 of the Code of Criminal Procedure (for short Cr.P.C)."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9d5a15b3de424530b9eff432c16c6f7c_36",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Therefore, I am sorry to subscribe to the argument advanced on behalf of the petitioner regarding the role of the Food Inspector in the matter of collection and sending of the sample not being in accordance with law."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "24f675ba5a4743e9baaeacecfda51b64_37",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "13. Now, coming to the next point of argument advanced on behalf of the petitioner regarding the fact that petitioner is protected under Section 19(2) of the Act."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "cb5537ffa89949969aa3c54256da5608_38",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "After careful perusal of the relevant materials it cannot be said that the petitioner was able to discharge his onus to prove that he purchased the seized articles from a manufacturer with the warranty."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "82d0f0fc976c45f8b78146dc141cebb9_39",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "He did not produce any evidence to that effect which shows that he purchased the seized articles from a manufacturer with a warranty in a prescribed form as per the provision of the Section 19 of the Act."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0fa38382fdb64194b2037748315e85e1_40",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The two cash memos Surendra Prasad Gupta vs The State Of West Bengal & Anr on 21 May, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/174533408/\n3 which were produced by the petitioner could not clarify that the seized article was a produc"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "89688c4e4ca04130acd68ca92670d552_41",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Under such circumstances, the petitioner cannot claim the benefit of Section 19(2) of the Act."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "22c4f76e7878437a8d4b115436954bc0_42",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "14. In the aforesaid view of the matter, I find that there has been no irregularity committed by the Ld. Trial Judge regarding the order of conviction against the petitioner herein as he has properly dealt with the evidence on record and al"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "741ecd2048964005adaa6a2a2ae2deff_43",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "15. But, although I uphold the findings of the Ld. Trial Court regarding the commission of offence but the only question now remains is of sentence."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f0780205c5414afb971a177efef3bab8_44",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The plea of the petitioner is regarding reduction of sentence and if only fine can be imposed, which is permissible as per the law currently applicable i.e.\nthe Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "15b358af84f64428ae7af413a014e6f8_45",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Section 52 of the present enactment provides for a maximum penalty of Rs. 3,00,000/- for misbranded food but there is no provision for imprisonment."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "46a2132562dd4b8d913ecaa862e8ec6e_46",
        "summary_section": "issue",
        "labels": [
          "ISSUE"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:issue"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "16. The only point left for consideration before this Court is whether the petitioner can be granted the benefit of the new legislation and be awarded a lesser punishment as is presently prescribed under the new law."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9048d717777c495a90eedf25a09c58d4_47",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "17. The Hon'ble Apex Court in this regard has held in various decisions including the case of A.K.\nSarkar (supra) that when an amendment is beneficial to the accused it can be applied even to cases pending in Courts where such a provision d"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "5d57da2085614eb696d01cedd315f562_48",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "18. In the present case, the offence itself is of the year of 1994."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c84006b3e0a94151ba870cb5031c0ac3_49",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Almost 30 years have elapsed since the commission of offence."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "029d5054a06742b6b403d5701fa677a0_50",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Considering all the aspects, more particularly the nature of offence though I do not find any irregularity in the findings of the Ld. Trial Judge I hereby convert the sentence of the petitioner from six (6) months of simple imprisonment alo"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "57b03c22f9084130b644c3cec72a2ad3_51",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The amount shall be deposited with the concerned Court within a period of three (3) weeks from date."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e15654f58b6247abae2ad40880fa8d15_52",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "19. Accordingly, the revision application being no. CRR 1463 of 2015 stands disposed of."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d41628538d6c47fcbdc5f420ce81121a_53",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "20. Interim order, if there be any, stands vacated."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "99bb5c2c315c457b9b6f15ea8267f70e_54",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
